<body>
    <h1>How to Set the Default Browser in IGEL OS 12</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>If a browser app is installed, it is automatically set as the de=
fault browser. If several browsers are installed on your system, you <span =
class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"d29088c2-e5a1-4326-83a6-5b9d13f=
fd23a">should </span>define a default browser. The default browser will be =
used for Single Sign-On (SSO).</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p><strong>Importance of Setting a Default Browser Correctly</strong></p>
<p>Please note the following:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If several browsers are installed and no browser is set as default, the =
browser whose name is last in alphabetical order is the default. Example: I=
f Chromium, Edge, Firefox, and Island are installed and no default browser =
is set, Island will be the default browser.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If several browsers are erroneously set as default, the browser from thi=
s selection whose name is last in alphabetical order will be the actual def=
ault.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<hr>
<p>In the following example, we will set the Chromium browser as the defaul=
t browser.</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>In the Web UMS, open the profile for your desired default browser.</p></=
li>
</ol><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper con=
fluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confl=
uence-content-image-border image-left" alt=3D"image-20241030-154127.png" wi=
dth=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"227450247e4a3904c3d7196dcbf4d143359eed8=
349fd5cbb25ae5e0dde3be35f" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki/download/attachments/201752952/image-20241030-154127.png?version=3D1=
&amp;modificationDate=3D1730302888435&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-height=3D"490" data-width=3D"1326" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" d=
ata-linked-resource-id=3D"206078005" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" dat=
a-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D=
"image-20241030-154127.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-id=3D"201752952" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"8" d=
ata-media-id=3D"71372f07-72cb-4f3a-a60c-c26691391e73" data-media-type=3D"fi=
le" height=3D"172"></span>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p>Go to <strong>System &gt; Registry &gt; app &gt; [your browser] &gt; mim=
etype &gt; default_browser</strong> and enable <strong>Default browser</str=
ong>, and save your settings.</p></li>
</ol><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper con=
fluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confl=
uence-content-image-border image-left" alt=3D"image-20241030-155441.png" wi=
dth=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"7404b84f8a7a3e7e12b0459c970fdd3bb5095d3=
c6394c27b77e8db9f5a14ab24" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki/download/attachments/201752952/image-20241030-155441.png?version=3D1=
&amp;modificationDate=3D1730303682937&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-height=3D"620" data-width=3D"1075" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" d=
ata-linked-resource-id=3D"206078014" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" dat=
a-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D=
"image-20241030-155441.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-id=3D"201752952" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"8" d=
ata-media-id=3D"4ff7b4e8-3935-4a1f-b61e-3503c238cf5e" data-media-type=3D"fi=
le" height=3D"270"></span>
